--- !u!114 &5271105205259553152
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5498254679594443945}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c962433d0afc61d4393255650f4c3186, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialougeRoute:
  - name: Siea
    lines: "There's something moving on the pile of snow... I tried to differentiate
      the white fabric from the white snow\u2014there's someone in the pile."
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9840b952ee9ebb64ba30561240b61235, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c06377504251e3f4e8431ff8460f9dbf, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"H..Help me.."'
    mirror: 1
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: I took a step back apon hearing the voice of a human.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"Please.. I''m dying.. Help me.."'
    mirror: 1
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: "Their voice sound pitiful.. wet, and in plead of help\u2014like a slug
      pleading for its life to be spared. I may not be cruel, neither am I a fool."
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: I used my foot to poke them, checking whether they are dangerous or not.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: I used my foot to poke them, checking whether they are dangerous or not.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: They didn't fight back, so I extended my hand out to lift them up.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9f2f7abc8ad94164b9363f2dc9126f2b, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"Ah.. thank you. Bless your kind soul.."'
    mirror: 1
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: Cloudy white hair as ice flakes, glowing yellow-amber eyes. Lashes long
      and feminine. Such beauty right in front me unable to discern whether I witnessed
      a man or a woman.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: dd5eeea8d4f2a1c48b99197e27055e0a, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8266f63fe9440b14dbfc6a456d20e85a, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: But judging from how they're dressed, that is a man, same age as me.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: He noticed my long glance at him. It made his pale cheeks shine a soft
      pink under the snow.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: f73a672a260cbd641b2dbe5570996b32, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"Why are.. you staring at me like that?"'
    mirror: 1
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"Nothin''"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: Wait a second, I don't recognize that clothing. If he's from another god
      worshipping tribe, I'm screwed. It'll also sound weird if I ask about it.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"How''d you get here? And why were you passed out in the snow?"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: "\"Oh m-me? I lost my footing and fell behind the tribe I was with. I
      saw this one scary monster come out of nowhere\u2014I ran until I couldn't
      breathe anymore.\""
    mirror: 1
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3023e1fa3576faa448706ddb24e1e3fc, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"I see, then.."'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: His answer sounded too earnest. I glanced at his clothing. They don't
      have any resemblences close to the Nokru-worshipping tribe, the fabric's too
      neat.. and it's pure white.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"Show me your hand! Who do you worhsip?!"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9f2f7abc8ad94164b9363f2dc9126f2b, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c06377504251e3f4e8431ff8460f9dbf, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"I don''t-"'
    mirror: 1
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: Without slowing down, I grabbed onto his wrist and lifted it up.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: "My blood ran cold apon seeing a glowing golden mark etched into his right
      hand\u2014Arva's symbol, the God of Light. The exact same mark on my arm."
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5a133829bf770014c9dfae8b4b8eef6b, type: 3}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2f04f8721a82e6a40869b5ac262da9cd, type: 3}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"An Outsider.."'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"You people.. are the sole reason this planet crumbled!!"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: He didn't flinch or blink; he only stared at me.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"I''m sorry if being what I am troubled you in some way."'
    mirror: 1
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"Don''t get your tone all soft! Your people burned down and massacred
      my people!"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"But you helped me."'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: His words struck my chest in some way. I bit down hard, my hand finding
      the knife at my waist, gripping the hilt hard enough to see my knuckles turning
      white.
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: Siea
    lines: '"I just don''t want my hands to be stained with blood..."'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"Then what are you going to do next, Siea?"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: SIea
    lines: '"Ho.. How''d you know my name??"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: ???
    lines: '"I can hear them.. whispering in the snow for a while now."'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 
  - name: SIea
    lines: '"What are you talking about..?"'
    mirror: 0
    backGround: {fileID: 0}
    eventSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sfx: {fileID: 0}
    effect: ChoiceMade
  dialougeGoodEnd: []
  deleteEnd: 1
